# Built packages. A .wgt built locally from .env.production has the Stash API
# key compiled in, so these must never be committed.
*.wgt

# A screenshot of the user's own Stash library, kept in the working tree as the
# visual reference for the Phase 4 redesign of the look. It is not repo content:
# it is explicit imagery carrying real scene titles, descriptions and performer
# thumbnails, so committing it would put the user's library in version control
# permanently — the same class of mistake as the .wgt above, and the same class
# as the key that survived its own history rewrite.
stash_ui.png

# Photographs of the TV taken during the 2026-10-23 AVPlay spike. Same reason
# as above: they are the user's screen, and they are evidence to read, not
# repo content. The spike itself is gone; these stay local.
avspike/

# Python bytecode from the harness server.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local roadmap notes from the 2026-10-28 additions scan. Working material,
